": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zUDP4U-D_mIQ7kNvwGhhMuX&_nc_oc=Adp_LYaSpTgOj-vD5k3ggfmK0ES8HC-SUpcHeoyq3twywiGc1NgrJVbHzPMPhobgAWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSFNB2zSJ2gUwSZf_n8lHd3UYVIHxuZE_CHz8kc767Ekw&oe=6B0B0D62"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y-huVFh7TD0Q7kNvwEB9hU5&_nc_oc=AdpJwjXRIkhhW3NVTCqxFO6NmStAgj2mRrIr9wt2FL3N1ziAc5s1ZKyWzpxzWD-VEwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ09Hx-KYK2FLMhmn4IDTeCAbIkgUyM6gKbZVe5LUUvzQ&oe=6B0B2CF6"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mP7UYFJby14Q7kNvwEkV26i&_nc_oc=AdrJm63pqRVA86IpN2zeQeN-pI2xXPAdfrm0TyDcbefNmq-aY7oQMkksBL32KOssAno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRILFj1IYxgdydrzgZmFPmdIf5tv7XO_svKp2VDxQX98A&oe=6B0B3464"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaBMi9YK5MIQ7kNvwGrg4zE&_nc_oc=AdrzM1RLu_B6KCOFFUcYcPowmOKGE1HaeMIPUNGfnBKy3KQAXFfrhl7k6ALsFp1Yrw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQbK9whOEYihHyzJl9yaaq8a0qD8_cSiDvhxYqmsHBZ9A&oe=6B0B19D0"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMIdQFxfSrkQ7kNvwH_qJNr&_nc_oc=AdqE56v-r_KLh-13dIdGo-pNFQchH5RamPkmHtbQe4CFZxPOrWkHQrxhZW4QiKnGnu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRR7YuPr30j5GieuCPW2cIb11UE-sg54Y05LNBZFI27hA&oe=6B0B1461"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MShPr58K_Y0Q7kNvwGFtc7j&_nc_oc=AdqIYJrNxZIdfqMyD5RRVK74oIevyOWpb-w7ivxosaqDuM72XlhroiH_H4C1bDg2YmA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT4ia2qiEUNimEXmzkn-Ugf2JcyvQY3tLKqso10xEX9wg&oe=6B0B375E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jyTsySSmK8Q7kNvwHSJEj5&_nc_oc=AdrOhEqPj5wM2hArYrewzwuehoWB4wdm_iaSeI-niJHs9gd6k5bvhLcDTvSneEwBDpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ8PlYZV70YqCcXPCeXZobl30tveKzzJI45og5XyzPI0g&oe=6B0B14BB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DfzTz1rjj7AQ7kNvwFq_ch9&_nc_oc=AdqgjL6w_SRUDHrLonyeuYjO9M_TYads9Fq8_w7X-SS793FlChCnIHQcFys8fhAufYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQp9w1Q_qJ5bj4cMkkTOimWNZkJda4FKyxfprT8GFt3gw&oe=6B0B3921"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_sGWcNQ-iEwQ7kNvwHfm1DV&_nc_oc=Adr4LBd61HMRPAAJ3Y-47I4bQzvx7eA86SdCIaNMWNZTyYJTVvt2wBP5qCeMekvR0qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQFGIAbPueeMF3KJUUJHG9kUT6niFc0k12O